# What the game calls its things, read from its own tables (dm/host/dm_names.c, the control port's `names`): each render entity's model file and
# each texture's file. The analysis tools join the table with the live harness's draw log; this checks that both tables are still where the
# reader looks (hundreds of models and textures in the camp), which a change of the game's layout would empty.
name names
requires cli
save warlock
timeout 120

enter_game
sleep 3
names names.tsv
quit
check log_has re="names: [1-9][0-9][0-9]+ models, [1-9][0-9][0-9]+ textures"
check no_red
